      "writtenOn": "2017-03-23T22:24:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could this be removed in R instead of Q? Asking because I\u0027m under the impression that we\u0027re going to have to force all users of a given cloud to reset their passwords and in some of my environments I\u0027ve hundreds, if not thousands of users which means coordinating a mass (forced) password reset for all users across all clouds and that may be a tough pill to swallow when trying to get it done for all deployments within a single cycle.",
